  "draft_py": "# Crystal Barricade (FDN), a 0/4 artifact creature (Wall) with defender for {1}{W}.\n# \"Defender\"                              compiled keyword, kept\n# \"You have hexproof.\"                    compiled [0] (B16-you-have-hexproof), kept\n# \"Prevent all noncombat damage that would be dealt to other creatures you control.\"\n# A static PREVENT_EFFECT of damage, M21 Pack Leader's verified \"prevent all combat damage that\n#   would be dealt this turn to Dogs you control\" (DamageDealtEvent with amount QUnbounded, the\n#   recipients in the event filter and mirrored in the atom's condition) as a static ability (no\n#   duration: while the Barricade is on the battlefield), with combat False for \"noncombat\" and\n#   the recipients \"other creatures you control\" (M21 Bolt Hound's verified filter: CONTROLLER_IS\n#   YOU, TYPE_EQ Creature, FNot IS_SOURCE). replacements.prevented_card_damage reads a static\n#   carrier while its source is on the battlefield.\nothers = FAnd(\n    children=(\n        FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.CONTROLLER_IS, who=ControllerRef.YOU),\n        FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n        FNot(inner=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_SOURCE)),\n    ),\n)\nprevent = StaticAbility(\n    effect=A(Verb.PREVENT_EFFECT, {\n        'condition': others,\n        'event': DamageDealtEvent(amount=QUnbounded(), filter=others, combat=False),\n    }),\n)\nabilities = [compiled[0], prevent, *compiled[1:]]\n",
  "clauses": [
   {
    "clause": "Defender",
    "ir": "keywords[0]"
   },
   {
    "clause": "You have hexproof.",
    "ir": "abilities[0]"
   },
   {
    "clause": "Prevent all noncombat damage that would be dealt to other creatures you control.",
    "ir": "abilities[1] (static PREVENT_EFFECT of noncombat damage to your other creatures)"
   }
  ],
  "g0_warnings": [],
  "notes": "M21 Pack Leader's damage prevention (verified: DamageDealtEvent filter mirrored in the condition) as a static, combat False, over M21 Bolt Hound's 'other creatures you control'. G3's one critical survivor, amount+1 on the compiled 'You have hexproof' selector (ONE_OF over your one player zone), is an equivalent mutant. Pack: tools/scenarios/mapped/FDN/crystal_barricade_prevents_only_noncombat_damage_to_your_others.json."
